## What this establishes and what remains pending

These results support the pure policy's captured display name, separate holder-group
identity, and imported internal sort key against the previously reviewed pinned
source calls. They do not establish live tree labels, actual on-screen sort order,
visual styling, resizing, focus, keyboard navigation, loading/empty/error states,
or Android-node test serialization. The `(Android)` test suffix remains a later
node/UI responsibility and is not appended by this policy.

